hadiths[60]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5332","unhon-ne apni biwi ko aik talaaq di to us waqt wo haaiza thin. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unko hukm diya ke rujoo' kar lein aur unhein us waqt tak apne sath rakhein jab tak wo us haiz se paak honey ke baad phir dobara haaiza na hun. us waqt bhi unse koi baat-cheet na karein aur jab wo us haiz se bhi paak ho jayen to agar us waqt unhein talaaq dene ka irada ho to tuhur mein us se pahley ke unse ham-bistarii karein, talaaq dein. to yahi wo waqt hai jiske mutaalliq Allah Taala ne hukm diya hai ke usmein aurton ko talaaq di jaey aur Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se agar iske (teen talaaq ke) barey mein sawal kya jata to sawal karne waley se wo kehtey ke agar tum ne teen talaaqein de di hain to phir tumhari biwi tum par haram hai. yahan tak ke wo tumharey siwa doosrey shauhar se nikah kare. (ghair Qutaiba) ke is hadis mein Leis se ye izafa kya hai ke (unhon-ne bayan kya ke) mujh se Naafe ne bayan kya aur unse ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke agar tum ne apni biwi ko aik ya 2 talaaq de di ho. (to tum usey dobara apne nikah mein la saktey ho ( kyonke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey iska hukm diya tha."
"5333","maine ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha to unhon-ne batlaya ke ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne apni biwi ko talaaq de di, us waqt wo haaiza thin. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne iske mutaalliq Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke ibne-Umar apni biwi se rujoo kar lein. phir jab talaaq ka sahi waqt aaey to talaaq dein ( Yunus bin Juber ne bayan kya ke ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se) maine puchha ke kya is talaaq ka bhi shumaar hua tha? unhon-ne batlaya ke agar koi talaaq dene wala shara' ke ehkaam bajaa laney se aajiz ho ya ahmaq bewaqoof ho (to kya talaaq nahi padegii?) ."
"5334","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas us waqt gaee jab unke walid Abu-Sufiyan bin Harab (Raziallahu anhu) ka intiqal hua tha. Umme-Habiba ne khushbu mangwai jis mein khalooq khushbu ki zardi ya kisi aur cheez ki milawat thi, phir wo khushbu aik londi ne unko lagai aur Ummul-Momenin ne khud apne rukhsaaron par usey lagaya. iske baad kaha ke Allah ki qasam! mujhey khushbu ke istemal ki koi khahish nahi thi lekin maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kisi aurat ke liye jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhti ho jaaiz nahi ke wo teen din se zyada kisi ka sog manaaey siwa shauhar ke (ke iska sog ( char mahiney das din ka hai."
"5335","iske baad mein Ummul-Momenin Zenab binte-Jahash (Raziallahu anha) ke yahan us waqt gaee jab unke bhai ka intiqal hua. unhon-ne bhi khushbu mangwai aur istemal kya kaha ke Allah ki qism ! mujhey khushbu ke istemal ki koi khahish nahi thi lekin maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko member par ye farmatey suna hai ke kisi aurat ke liye jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhti ho ye jaaiz nahi ke kisi maiyat par teen din se zyada sog manaaey, sirf shauhar ke liye char mahiney das din ka sog hai."
"5336","aik khatun Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaein aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! meri ladki ke shauhar ka intiqal ho gaya hai aur uski aankhon mein takleef hai to kya wo surma laga sakti hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke nahi, 2 teen martaba (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya (har martaba ye farmatey they ke nahi ! phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye ( sharaee iddat ( char mahiney aur das din hi ki hai. jahiliyat main to tumhen saal bhar tak mengni phenknii padtii thi (jab kahin iddat se bahar hoti thi)."
"5337","iska kya matlab hai ke ''saal bhar tak mengni phenknii padtii thi? '' unhon-ne farmaya ke zamane jahiliyat mein jab kisi aurat ka shauhar mar jata to wo aik bahut hi zyada tang w taareek kothhrii mein dakhil ho jati. sabse burey kapdey pahantii aur khushbu ka istemal tark kar deti. yahan tak ke usi haalat mein aik saal guzar jata phir kisi chaupaaey gadhey ya bakri ya parinde ko uske paas laya jata aur wo iddat se bahar aaney ke liye is par hath phertii. aisa kam hota tha ke wo kisi janwar par hath pher de aur wo mar na jaey. iske baad wo nikaalii jati aur usey mengni di jati jisey wo phainktii. ab wo khushbu wghaira koi bhi cheez istemal kar sakti thi. Imam Malik se puchha gaya ke) تفتض به (ka kya matlab hai to aap ne farmaya wo uska jism chhootii thi."
"5338","aik aurat ke shauhar ka intiqal ho gaya, iske baad uski aankh mein takleef hui to iske ghar waley Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur aap se surma lagaaney ki ijazat mangi . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke surma ( zamana iddat mein) na lagaao .) zamana jahiliyat mein) tumhen badtareen kapdey mein waqt guzaarnaa padta tha, ya ( rawi ko shak tha ke ye farmaya ke) badtareen ghar mein waqt ( iddat ( guzaarnaa padta tha. jab is tarah aik saal pura ho jata to uske paas se kutta guzarta aur wo is par mengni phainktii (jab iddat se bahar aati ( to surma na lagaao . yahan tak ke char mahiney das din guzar jaaein."
"5339","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aik musalman aurat jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhti ho. uske liye jaaiz nahi ke wo kisi (ki wafat (ka sog teen din se zyada manaaey siwa shauhar ke ke uske liye char mahiney das din hain."
"5340","hamein mana kya gaya hai ke shauhar ke siwa kisi ka sog teen din se zyada manaaein ."
"5341","hamein us se mana kya gaya ke kisi maiyat ka teen din se zyada sog manaaein siwa shauhar ke ke uske liye char mahiney das din ki iddat thi. is arse mein ham na surma lagaatey na khushbu istemal kartey aur na ranga kapda pahntey they. albatta wo kapda us se alag tha jiska (dhaagaa) banney se pahley hi rang diya gaya ho. hamein uski ijazat thi ke agar koi haiz ke baad ghusl karey to us waqt azfaar ka thoda sa aud istemal kar ley aur hamein janaaze ke peechhey chalney ki bhi manaahii thi."
"5342","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo aurat Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhti ho uske liye jaaiz nahi ke teen din se zyada kisi ka sog manaaey siwa shauhar ke wo iske sog mein na surma lagaey na ranga hua kapda pahney magar Yaman ka dhaarii daar kapda (jo banney se pahley hi ranga gaya ho ( ."
"5343","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke) kisi maiyat par) khawind ke siwa teen din se zyada sog karne se aur) farmaya ke) khushbu ka istemal na karey, siwa tuhur ke waqt jab haiz se paak ho to thoda sa ud ( qist (aur ( maqam ( azfaar (ki khushbu istemal kar sakti hai) , abu-Adbullah (Imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ( kehtey hain ke) qist (aur ( الكست ( aik hi cheez hain, jaisey '' kaafoor ''aur ''qaafoor'' donon aik hain."
"5344","aayate-karima ( والذين يتوفون منكم ويذرون أزواجا‏ ( الخ , yani ''aur jo log tum mein se wafat pa jayen aur beeviyan chhod jaaein. '' ke mutaalliq kaha ke ye iddat jo shauhar ke ghar walon ke paas guzari jati thi, pahley wajib thi, isliye Allah Taala ne ye aayat utaarii والذين يتوفون منكم ويذرون أزواجا وصية لأزواجهم متاعا إلى الحول غير إخراج فإن خرجن فلا جناح عليكم فيما فعلن في أنفسهن من معروف yaanii ''aur jo log tum mein se wafat pa jayen aur beeviyan chhod jayen (un par lazim hai ke) apni beeviyon ke haq mein nafa uthaney ki wasiiyat kar jayen ke wo aik saal tak ( ghar se) na nikaalii jayen lekin agar wo ( khud ( nikal jayen to koi gunah tum par nahiin '' is barey mein jisey wo ( beeviyan ( apne barey mein dastoor ke mutabiq karein. Mujahid ne kaha ke Allah Taala ne aisi bewa ke liye saat (7) mahiney bees din saal bhar mein se wasiiyat qarar di. agar wo chahey to shauhar ki wasiiyat ke mutabiq wahin thahrii rahe aur agar chahey (chaar mahiney das din ki iddat) poori karke wahan se chali jaey. Allah Taala ke irshad ( إخراج فإن خرجن فلا جناح عليكم‏ ( tak yani '' unhein nikala na jaey. albatta agar wo khud chali jayen to tum par koi gunah nahi. '' ka yahi mansha hai. to iddat to jaisi ke pahley thi, ab bhi is par wajib hai. ibne-abi najeeh ne usey Mujahid se bayan kya aur Ata ne bayan kya ke Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke us pehli aayat ne bewa ko khawind ke ghar mein iddat guzarney ke hukm ko mansukh kar diya, isliye ab wo jahan chahey iddat guzaarey aur (isii tarah is aayat ne) Allah Taala ke irshad (ghair ikhraaj) yani '' unhein nikala na jaaey.'' (ko bhi mansukh kar diya hai). Ata ne kaha ke agar wo chahey to apne (shauhar ke) ghar walon ke yahan hi iddat guzaarey aur wasiiyat ke mutabiq qiyam karey aur agar chahey wahan se chali aaey kyonke Allah Taala ne farmaya hai) فلا جناح عليكم فيما فعلن‏ ( الخ , yani '' to tum par iska koi gunah nahi, jo wo apni marzii ke mutabiq karein. '' Ata ne kaha ke iske baad meeraas ka hukm nazil hua aur us ne makan ke hukm ko mansukh kar diya. to wo jahan chahey iddat guzaar sakti hai aur uske liye ( shauhar ki taraf se) makan ka intizam nahi hoga."
"5345","jab unke walid ki wafat ki khabar pahunchi to unhon-ne khushbu mangwai aur apne donon baazuon par lagai phir kaha ke mujhey khushbu ki koi zarurat na thi lekin maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai ke jo aurat Allah aur aakhirat par eman rakhti ho wo kisi maiyat ka teen din se zyada sog na manaaey siwa shauhar ke ke uske liye char mahiney das din hain."
"5346","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kuttey ki qeemat, kaahin ki kamaaii aur zaaniya aurat ke zina ki kamaaii khaney se mana farmaya,"
"5347","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne godney wali aur gudwaaney wali , sood khaney waley aur khilaaney waley par laanat bheji aur aap ne kuttey ki qeemat aur zaaniya ki kamaaii khaney se mana farmaya aur tasweer banaaney walon par laanat ki."
"5348","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne laundiyon ke zina ki kamaaii se mana farmaya,"
"5349","maine ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aisey shakhs ke barey mein sawal kya jisne apni biwi par tohmat lagai ho to unhon-ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qabila bani Ajlan ke miyan biwi mein judai kara di thi aur farmaya tha ke Allah khub janta hai ke tum mein se aik jhoota hai, to kya wo rujoo karega? lekin donon ne inkar kya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dobara farmaya ke Allah khub janta hai usey jo tum mein se aik jhoota hai wo tauba karta hai ya nahi ? lekin donon ne phir tauba se inkar kya. to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unmein judai kara di. Ayub ne bayan kya ke mujh se Amr-bin-Dinar ne kaha ke haan, hadis mein aik cheez aur hai maine tumhen usey bayan kartey nahi dekha. wo ye hai ke) tohmat lagaaney waale) shauhar ne kaha tha ke mera maal ( mehar ( dilwaa dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke wo tumhara maal hi nahi raha, agar tum sachey bhi ho to tum us se khilwat kar chukey ho aur agar jhootey ho tab to tum ko kuchh milnaa hi nahi chahiye ."
"5350","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne liaan karne waley miyan biwi se farmaya ke tumhara hisab Allah ke yahan hoga. tum mein se aik to yaqinan jhoota hai. tumharey yani ( shauhar ke) liye usey ( biwi ko) hasil karne ka ab koi rasta nahi hai. shauhar ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! mera maal ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ab wo tumhara maal nahi raha. agar tum ne iske mutaalliq sach kaha tha to wo iske badle mein hai ke tum ne uski sharmgah apne liye halal ki thi aur agar tum ne is par jhooti tohmat lagai thi tab to aur zyada tujh ko kuchh na milnaa chahiye ."
"5351","maine unse puchha kya tum us hadis ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat kartey ho. unhon-ne kaha ke ji haan , Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab musalman apne ghar main apne joru baal bachchon par Allah ka hukm ada karne ki niyat se kharch karey to usmein bhi usko sadqey ka sawab milta hai."
"5352","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala farmata hai ke aey ibne-Aadam! to kharch kar to main tujh ko diye jaaunga."
"5353","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke bewaon aur miskinon ke kaam aaney wala Allah ke rastey mein jihad karne waley ke barabar hai, ya raat bhar ibadat aur din ko rozey rakhney waley ke barabar hai."
"5354","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) meri iyaadat ke liye tashrif laaiye . main us waqt Makka Mukarrama mein bimar tha. maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke mere paas maal hai. kya main apne tamam maal ki wasiiyat kar dun? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi. maine kaha phir aadhey ki kar dun? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi ! maine kaha, phir tehai ki kar dun ( farmaya ( tehai ki kar do aur tehai bhi bahut hai. agar tum apne waarison ko maaldaar chhod kar jao ye us se behtar hai ke tum unhein mohtaaj w tang dast chhodo ke logon ke samney wo hath phailaatey phirein aur tum jab bhi kharch karogey to wo tumhari taraf se sadqa hoga. yahan tak ke us luqme par bhi sawab milega jo tum apni biwi ke munh mein rakhney ke liye uthaaogey aur ummeed hai ke abhi Allah tumhen zinda rakhega, tum se bahut se logon ko nafa pahunchega aur bahut se doosrey (kaafir) nuqsan uthaaengey."
"5355","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke sabse behtreen sadqa wo hai jisey de kar dene wala maaldaar hi rahe aur har haal mein uper ka hath ( dene waley ka ( nichey ke) leney waley ke) hath se behtar hai aur) kharch ki) shuruaat unse karo jo tumhari nigahbaanii mein hain. aurat ko us mutaalbe ka haq hai ke mujhey khana de warna talaaq de. ghulam ko us mutalba ka haq hai ke mujhey khana do aur mujh se kaam lo. betaa keh sakta hai ke mujhey khana khilaao ya kisi aur par chhod do. logon ne kaha : aey Abu-Hurera ! kya (ye aakhiri tukda bhi) ke joru kehti hai aakhir tak. aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi balke ye Abu-Hurera ki khud apni samajh hai."
"5356","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke behtreen khairat wo hai jisey dene par aadmi maaldaar hi rahe aur shuruaat unse karo jo tumhari nigrani mein hain jinke khilaaney pahnaaney ke tum zimme daar ho."
"5357","tum ne aisey shakhs ke barey mein bhi suna hai jo apne ghar walon ke liye saal bhar ka ya saal se kam ka kharch jama kar ley. Mamar ne bayan kya ke us waqt mujhey yad nahi aaya phir baad mein yad aaya ke is barey mein aik hadis ibne-Shahab ne ham se bayan ki thi, unse Malik bin Aus ne aur unse ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bani Nazir ke baagh ki khajoorein bech kar apne ghar walon ke liye saal bhar ki rozii jama kar diya kartey they."
"5358","mujhey Malik bin Aus bin hadsaan ne khabar di (ibne-Shahaab Zohri ne bayan kya ke) Muhammad-bin Juber bin Mut-im ne iska kuchh hissey bayan kya tha, isliye main rawaana hua aur Malik bin Aus ki khidmat mein pahuncha aur unse ye hadis poochhii. Malik ne mujh se bayan kya ke main umr (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to unke darbaan Yarfaa unke paas aaey aur kaha Usman-bin-Affan , Abdur-Rehman , Zaid aur Sad (Raziallahu anhu) (aap se milney ki) ijazat chahtey hain kya aap unhein uski ijazat dengey ? umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke andar bula lo. chunanche unhein uski ijazat de di gaee. rawi ne kaha ke phir ye sab andar tashrif laey aur salam karke baith gaey. Yarfaa ne thodi der ke baad phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) se aa kar kaha ke Ali aur Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) bhi milnaa chahtey hain kya aap ki taraf se ijazat hai? umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein bhi andar bulaney ke liye kaha, andar aa kar un hazraat ne bhi salam kya aur baith gaey. iske baad Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, ameerul-momineen mere aur un ( Ali (Raziallahu anhu)) ke darmyan faisla kar dijiye. doosrey sahaba Usman (Raziallahu anhu) aur unke sathiyon ne bhi kaha ke ameerul-momineen unka faisla farma dijiye aur unhein us uljhan se nijat dijiye. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha jaldi na karo main Allah ki qism de kar tum se poochhta hun jiske hukm se aasman w zameen qaaim hain. kya tumhen malum hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya hai hamara koi waaris nahi hota, jo kuchh ham anbiya wafat ke waqt chhodtey hain wo sadqa hota hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ishara khud apni zaat ki taraf tha. sahaba ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye irshad farmaya tha. iske baad umr (Raziallahu anhu) Ali aur Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf mutwajjeh huey aur unse puchha mein Allah ki qism de kar aap se poochhta hun, kya aap logon ko malum hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye irshad farmaya tha. unhon-ne bhi tasdeeq ki ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne waqei ye farmaya tha. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ab main aap se us maamle mein baat karunga . Allah Taala ne apne rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko us maal mein Mukhtar kal honey ki khusoosiyat bakhshii thi aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke siwa usmein se kisi doosrey ko kuchh nahi diya tha. Allah Taala ne irshad farmaya thaa ما أفاء الله على رسوله منهم فما أوجفتم عليه من خيل‏ se ( qadeer ( tak. '' isliye ye ( char khums ( khas aap ke liye they. Allah ki qism Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumhen nazar andaz karke us maal ko apne liye khas nahi kar liya tha aur na tumhara kam karke usey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne liye rakha tha, balke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pahley tum sab mein uski taqseem ki aakhir mein jo maal baqi reh gaya to usmein se aap apne ghar walon ke liye saal bhar ka kharch letey aur uske baad jo baqi bachta usey Allah ke maal ke kharch hi main (musalmanon ke liye) kharch kar detey. aap ne apni zindagi bhar usi ke mutabiq amal kya. aey Usmaan! main tumhen Allah ki qism deta hun, kya tumhen ye malum hai? sab ne kaha ke ji haan, phir aap ne Ali aur Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se poochha, main tumhen Allah ki qism deta hun, kya tumhen ye bhi malum hai? unhon-ne bhi kaha ke ji haan malum hai. phir Allah Taala ne apne Nabi ki wafat ki aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka khaleefa hun. chunanche unhon-ne us jaaidaad ko apne qabze mein ley liya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke amal ke mutabiq usmein amal kya. Ali aur Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf mutwajjeh ho kar unhon-ne kaha, aap donon us waqt maujood they, aap khub jantey hain ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne aisa hi kya tha aur Allah janta hai ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) usmein mukhlis, mohtaat w nek-niiyat aur sahi rastey par they aur haq ki ittaba (pairvi) karne waley they. phir Allah Taala ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki bhi wafat ki aur ab main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ka jaa-nasheen hun. mein 2 saal se us jaaidaad ko apne qabze mein liye huey hon aur wahi karta hun jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne usmein kya tha. ab aap hazraat mere paas aaey hain, aap ki baat aik hi hai aur aap ka mamla bhi aik hai. aap (Abbaas (rz)) aaey aur mujh se apne bhatijey (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)) ki wiraasat ka mutalba kya aur aap (Ali (Raziallahu anhu)) aaey aur unhon-ne apni biwi ki taraf se unke walid ke tarke ka mutalba kya. maine aap donon se kaha ke agar aap chaahein to main aapko ye jaaidaad de sakta hun lekin us shart ke sath ke aap par Allah ka ahad wajib hoga. wo ye ke aap donon bhi us jaaidaad mein wahi tarze-amal rakhengey jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rakha tha, jiske mutabiq Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne amal kya aur jab se main iska wali hua hun, maine jo iske sath mamla rakha aur agar ye shart manzoor na ho to phir aap mujh se is barey mein guftgu chhodein. aap logon ne kaha ke us shart ke mutabiq wo jaaidaad hamarey hawale kar do aur maine usey us shart ke sath tum logon ke hawale kar diya. kyon Usman aur unke saathiyon! mein aapko Allah ki qism deta hun maine us shart hi par wo jaaidaad Ali aur Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke qabze mein di hai naa? unhon-ne kaha ke ji haan. rawi ne bayan kya ke phir aap Ali aur Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf mutwajjeh huey aur kaha, main aap hazraat ko Allah ki qism deta hun kya maine aap donon ke hawale wo us shart ke sath ki thi? donon hazraat ne farmaya ke ji haan. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya, kya aap hazraat ab iske siwa mujh se koi aur faisla chahtey hain? us zaat ki qism hai jiske hukm se aasman w zameen qaaim hain iske siwa main koi aur faisla qiyamat tak nahi kar sakta. ab log uski zimme-dari poori karne se aajiz hain to mujhey wapas kar dein main iska bando-bast aap hi kar loonga."
"5359","Hind binte- Utba (Raziallahu anhu) hazir huin aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! Abu-Sufiyan (unke shauhar ( bahut kanjoos hain, to kya mere liye usmein koi gunah hai agar main unke maal mein se (iske peeth peechhey ( apne bachchon ko khilaaun ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi, lekin dastoor ke mutabiq hona chahiye"
"5360","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar aurat apne shauhar ki kamaaii mein se, iske hukm ke baghair (dastoor ke mutaabiq) Allah ke raaste mein kharch kar de to usey bhi aadha sawab milta hai."
"5361","Fatima (Raziallahu anha) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein ye shikayat karne ke liye hazir huin ke chakkii peesney ki wjah se unke hathon mein kitni takleef hai. unhein malum hua tha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas kuchh ghulam aaey hain lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se unki mulaqat na ho sakii. isliye Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se iska zikr kya. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey to Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne aap se iska tazkira kya. Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey yahan tashrif laey (raat ke waqt) ham us waqt apne bistaron par let chukey they ham ne uthna chaha Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum donon jis tarah they isi tarah raho. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere aur Fatima ke darmyan baith gaey. maine aap ke qadmon ki thandak apne pet par mehsus ki. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, tum donon ne jo cheez mujh se mangi hai, kya main tumhen us se behtar aik baat na bata dun? jab tum (raat ke waqt) apne bistar par let jao to 33 martaba ( sub'haanallaah ( , Mina 33 martaba (alhamdulillah) aur 34 martaba ( Allahu-akbar ( padh liya karo ye tumharey liye londi ghulam se behtar hai."
"5545","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aaj (eidul-Az'haa ke din) ki shuruaat ham Namaz (eid) se karengey phir wapas aa kar qurbani karengey jo is tarah karega wo hamari sunnat ke mutabiq karega lekin jo shakhs (namaaze-eid se) pahley zabah karega to uski haisiyat sirf gosht ki hogi jo usney apne ghar walon ke liye taiyaar kar liya hai qurbani wo hargiz bhi nahi. is par abu-Barda-bin-Niyaar (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey unhon-ne (namaz eid se pahley hi ( zabah kar liya tha aur arz kya ke mere paas aik saal se kam Umr ka bakra hai (kya uski dobara qurbani ab Namaz ke baad kar loon?) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke uski qurbani kar lo lekin tumharey baad ye kisi aur ke liye kafi nahi hoga. Mutarrif ne Aamir se bayan kya aur unse Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisne Namaz eid ke baad qurbani ki uski qurbani poori hogi aur us ne musalmanon ki sunnat ke mutabiq amal kya."
"5546","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisne Namaz eid se pahley qurbani kar li us ne apni zaat ke liye janwar zabah kya aur jisne Namaz eid ke baad qurbani ki uski qurbani poori hui. us ne musalmanon ki sunnat ko pa liya."
"5547","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sahaba mein qurbani ke janwar taqseem kiye. Aqba (Raziallahu anhu) ke hisse mein aik saal se kam ka bakri ka bachcha aaya. unhon-ne bayan kya ke is par maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! mere hisse main to aik saal se kam ka bachcha aaya hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum usi ki qurbani kar lo."
"5548","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (hijjatul-wadaa ke mauqe par) unke paas aaey wo Makka Mukarrama mein dakhil honey se pahley maqam sarf main haaiza ho gaee thin. us waqt aap ro rahi thin. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke kya baat hai kya tumhen haiz ka khoon aaney laga hai? Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne arz kya ke ji haan. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye to Allah Taala ne Adam (Alaihissalam) ki betiyon ke muqaddar mein likh diya hai. tum haajiyon ki tarah tamam aa'maale-Haj ada kar lo bas Baitullah ka tawaaf na karo, phir jab ham Mina mein they, to hamarey paas gaaey ka gosht laya gaya. maine puchha ke ye kya hai? logon ne bataya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni beeviyon ki taraf se gaaey ki qurbani ki hai."
"5549","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qurbani ke din farmaya ke jisne Namaz eid se pahley qurbani zabah kar li hai wo dobara qurbani karey is par aik sahib ne khadey ho kar arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ye wo din hai jis mein gosht khaney ki khahish hoti hai phir unhon-ne apne padausiyon ka zikr kya aur (kaha ke) mere paas aik saal se kam ka bakri ka bachcha hai jiska gosht 2 bakriyon ke gosht se behtar hai to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein uski ijazat de di. mujhey nahi malum ke ye ijazat dusron ko bhi hai ya nahi. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) 2 mendhon ki taraf mudey aur unhein zabah kya phir log bakriyon ki taraf badhey aur unhein taqseem karke (zabah kya)."
"5550","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke zamana phir kar usi haalat par aa gaya hai jis haalat par us din tha jis din Allah Taala ne aasman w zameen paida kiye they. saal baara mahina ka hota hai unmein char hurmat ke mahiney hain, teen pai-dar-pai zii-Qa'da, Zil-Hijja aur Mohrim aur aik muzar ka rajab jo jumaadal-Ukhraa aur Shoban ke darmyan mein padta hai. (phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya) ye kon sa mahina hai, ham ne arz kya Allah aur uske rasool zyada jantey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khamosh ho gaey. ham ne samjha ke shayad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) iska koi aur naam rakhengey lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya ye Zil-Hijja nahi hai? ham ne arz kya Zil-Hijja hi hai. phir farmaya ye kon sa Shahar hai? ham ne kaha ke Allah aur uske rasool ko iska zyada ilm hai. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khamosh ho gaey aur ham ne samjha ke shayad aap iska koi aur naam rakhengey lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya ye Makka Mukarrama nahi hai? ham ne arz kya kyon nahi. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ye din kon sa hai? ham ne arz kya ke Allah aur uske rasool ko iska behtar ilm hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khamosh ho gaey aur ham ne samjha ke aap iska koi aur naam tajwiz karengey lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya ye qurbani ka din nahi hai? ham ne arz kya kyon nahi ! phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya to tumhara khoon , tumharey maal, Muhammad-bin-Siiriin ne bayan kya ke mera khayal hai ke (ibne-Ubaii bakra ne) ye bhi kaha ke aur tumhari izzat tum par (eik ki doosrey par) is tarah baa-hurmat hain jis tarah us din ki hurmat tumharey is Shahar main aur is maheene mein hai aur an-qareeb apne rab se milogey us waqt wo tum se tumharey aamaal ke barey mein sawal karega. aagah ho jao mere baad gumrah na ho jana ke tum mein se kuchh kuchh doosrey ki gardan maarney lagey. haan jo yahan maujood hain wo (meraa ye paighaam) ghair maujood logon ko pahuncha dein. mumkin hai ke kuchh wo jinhein ye paigham pahunchaya jaey kuchh unse zyada usey mehfooz karne waley hon jo isey sun rahe hain. is par Muhammad-bin-Siiriin kaha kartey they ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sach farmaya, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aagah ho jao kya maine (iska paigham tum ko) pahuncha diya hai. aagah ho jao kya maine pahuncha diya hai?"
"5551","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) qurbaan gaah mein nehar kya kartey they aur Ubaidullah ne bayan kya ke murad wo jagah hai jahan Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qurbani kartey they."
"5552","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( qurbani ( zabah aur nehar eidgaah mein kya kartey they."
"5553","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) 2 mendhon ki qurbani kartey they aur main bhi 2 mendhon ki qurbani karta tha."
"5554","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) seeng waley 2 chitkabrey mendhon ki taraf mutwajjeh huey aur unhein apne hath se zabah kya. uski mutabiat (pairavi) Wuhaib ne ki, unse Ayub ne aur Ismail aur Haakim-bin-Wardaan ne bayan kya ke unse Ayub ne, unse Muhammad-bin-Siiriin ne aur unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya."
"5555","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sahaba mein taqseem karne ke liye aapko kuchh qurbani ki bakriyan diin unhon-ne unhein taqseem kya phir aik saal se kam ka aik bachcha bach gaya to unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iska tazkira kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke uski qurbani tum kar lo."
"5556","mere maamun abu-Barda (Raziallahu anhu) ne eid ki Namaz se pahley hi qurbani kar li thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke tumhari bakri sirf gosht ki bakri hai. unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! mere paas aik saal se kam Umr ka aik bakri ka bachcha hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum usey hi zabah kar lo lekin tumharey baad) uski qurbani ( kisi aur ke liye jaaiz nahi hogi phir farmaya jo shakhs Namaz eid se pahley qurbani kar leta hai wo sirf apne khaney ko janwar zabah karta hai aur jo eid ki Namaz ke baad qurbani karey uski qurbani poori hoti hai aur wo musalmanon ki sunnat ko pa leta hai. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Ubeda ne Shabi aur Ibrahim ne ki aur uski mutabiat (pairavi) Wakee ne ki, unse Hurais ne aur unse Shabi ne ( bayan kya (aur Aasim aur Dawud ne Shabi se bayan kya ke '' mere paas aik doodh peeti pathiya hai.'' aur Zubeda aur faraas ne Shabi se bayan kya ke '' mere paas aik saal se kam Umr ka bachcha hai.'' aur abul-Ahwas ne bayan kya, unse Mansoor ne bayan kya ke ''eik saal se kam ki pathiya . ''aur ibne-aun ne bayan kya ke ''eik saal se kam Umr ki doodh peeti pathiya hai.''"
"5557","abu-Barda (Raziallahu anhu) ne namaaze-eid se pahley qurbani zabah kar li thi to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke iske badley mein dusri qurbani kar lo. unhon-ne arz kya ke mere paas aik saal se kam Umr ke bachchey ke siwa aur koi janwar nahi. Shoba ne bayan kya ke mera khayal hai ke abu-Barda (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye bhi kaha tha ke wo aik saal ki bakri se bhi umda hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir usi ki iske badley mein qurbani kar do lekin tumharey baad ye kisi ke liye kafi nahi hogi aur Haatim-bin-Wardaan ne bayan kya, unse Ayub ne, unse Muhammad ne aur unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aakhir hadis tak (is riwayat mein ye lafz hain) ke ''eik saal se kam Umr ki bachchii hai.''"
"5558","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 2 chitkabrey mendhon ki qurbani ki. maine dekha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne paon janwar ke uper rakhey huey hain aur bismillaahi-Allaahu-akbar padh rahe hain. is tarah aap ne donon mendhon ko apne hath se zabah kya."
"5559","maqam sarf main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere paas tashrif laey aur main ro rahi thi to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya baat hai, kya tumhen haiz aa gaya hai? maine arz kya ji haan. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye to Allah Taala ne Adam ki betiyon ki taqdeer mein likh diya hai. isliye haajiyon ki tarah tamam aa'maale Haj anjam do sirf Kaba ka tawaaf na karo aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne beeviyon ki taraf se gaaey ki qurbani ki."
"5560","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khutba de rahe they. khutbe mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aaj ke din ki shuruaat ham Namaz (eid) se karengey phir wapas aa kar qurbani karengey jo shakhs is tarah karega wo hamari sunnat ko pa lega lekin jisne (eid ki Namaz se pahley) janwar zabah kar liya to wo aisa gosht hai jisey usne apne ghar walon ke khaney ke liye taiyaar kya hai wo qurbani kisi darje mein bhi nahi. abu-Barda (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! maine to eid ki Namaz se pahley qurbani kar li hai albatta mere paas abhi aik saal se kam Umr ka aik bakri ka bachcha hai aur saal bhar ki bakri se behtar hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum usi ki qurbani uske badle mein karo lekin tumharey baad ye kisi ke liye jaaiz na hoga."
"5561","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisne Namaz se pahley qurbani kar li ho wo dobara qurbani kare. is par aik sahabi uthey aur arz kya : (ya rasoolullaah!) us din gosht ki logon ko khahish zyada hoti hai phir unhon-ne apne padausiyon ki mohtaajii ka zikr kya jaisey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka uzr qabool kar liya ho ( unhon-ne ye bhi kaha ke) mere paas aik saal ka aik bachcha hai aur bakriyon se bhi achchha hai. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein iske qurbani ki ijazat de di lekin mujhey iska ilm nahi ke ye ijazat dusron ko bhi thi ya nahi phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) 2 mendhon ki taraf mutwajjeh huey. unki murad ye thi ke unhein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne zabah kya phir log bakriyon ki taraf mutwajjeh huey aur unhein zabah kya."
"5562","qurbani ke din main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisne Namaz se pahley qurbani kar li ho wo uski jagah dobara karey aur jisne qurbani abhi na ki ho wo kare."
"5563","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik din Namaz eid padhi aur farmaya ke jo hamari tarah Namaz padhta ho aur hamarey qible ko qibla banata ho wo namaaze-eid se farigh honey se pahley qurbani na kare. is par abu-Barda-bin-Niyaar (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah! maine to qurbani kar li. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya phir wo aik aisi cheez hui jisey tum ne waqt se pahley hi kar liya hai. unhon-ne arz kya mere paas aik saal se kam Umr ka aik bachcha hai jo aik saal ki 2 bakriyon se umda hai. kya main usey zabah kar loon. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kar lo lekin tumharey baad ye kisi aur ke liye jaaiz nahi hai. Aamir ne bayan kya ke ye unki behtreen qurbani thi."
"5564","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) seeng waley 2 chitkabrey mendhon ki qurbani kya kartey they aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apna paon unki gardanon ke uper rakhtey aur unhein apne hath se zabah kartey they."
"5565","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne seeng waley 2 chitkabrey mendhon ki qurbani ki. unhein apne hath se zabah kya. bismillaahi Allahu-akbar padha aur apna paon unki gardan ke uper rakh kar zabah kya."
"5566","wo Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein aaey aur arz kya ke ummul-momeneen! agar koi shakhs qurbani ka janwar Kaba mein bhej de aur khud apne Shahar mein muqeem ho aur jiske zariey bhejey usey uski wasiiyat kar de ke iske janwar ke galley main (nishaanii ke taur par) aik haar pehna diya jaey to kya us din se wo us waqt tak ke liye mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) ho jaeyga jab tak haji apna ehram na khol lein. bayan kya ke is par maine pardey ke peechhey Ummul-Momenin ke apne aik hath se doosrey hath par maarney ki awaz suni aur unhon-ne kaha, main khud Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qurbani ke janwaron ke haar bandhti thi, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey Kaba bhejtey they lekin logon ke wapas honey tak Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par koi cheez haram nahi hoti thi jo unke ghar ke doosrey logon ke liye halal ho."
"5567","Madina pahunchne tak ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein qurbani ka gosht jama kartey they aur kai martaba ( bajaey ( لحوم الأضاحي ( ke) ( لحوم الهدى‏ . Mina (ka lafz istemal kya."
"5568","wo safar mein they jab wapas aaey to unke samney gosht laya gaya. kaha gaya ke ye hamari qurbani ka gosht hai. abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke usey hataao mein usey nahi chakhoonga. abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir uth gaya aur ghar se bahar nikal kar apne bhai abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaya wo maa ki taraf se unke bhai they aur badr ki ladai mein shirkat karne walon mein se they. maine unse iska zikr kya aur unhon-ne kaha ke tumharey baad hukm badal gaya hai."
"5569","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisne tum mein se qurbani ki to teesrey din wo us haalat mein subah karey ke uske ghar mein qurbani ke gosht mein se kuchh bhi baqi na ho. doosrey saal sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! kya ham is saal bhi wahi karein jo pichhley saal kya tha. (ke teen din se zyada qurbani ka gosht bhi na rakhein). Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ab khaao, khilaao aur jama karo. pichhley saal to chunkey log tangi mein mubtala they, isliye maine chaha ke tum logon ki mushkilaat mein unki madad karo."
"5570","Madina mein ham qurbani ke gosht mein namak laga kar rakh detey they aur phir usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein bhi pesh kartey they phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qurbani ka gosht teen din se zyada na khaya karo. ye hukm zaroori nahi tha balke aap ka mansha ye tha ke ham qurbani ka gosht (un logon ko bhi jinke yahan qurbani na hui ho ( khilaaein aur Allah zyada jaanney wala hai."
"5571","mujhey ibne- azhar ke ghulam abu Ubaid ne bayan kya ke wo Baaqar eid ke din umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath eidgaah mein maujood they. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne khutbe se pahley eid ki Namaz padhai phir logon ke samney khutba diya aur khutbe mein farmaya aey logo ! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumhen 2 Eidon mein roza rakhney se mana farmaya hai aik wo din hai jis din tum ( Ramazan ke) rozey poorey karke iftaar kartey ho ( eidul-fitr (aur doosra tumhari qurbani ka din hai."
"5572","phir main Usman-bin-Affan (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath (unki khilafat ke zamane mein eidgaah mein) hazir tha. us din Juma bhi tha. aap ne khutbe se pahley Namaz eid padhai phir khutba diya aur farmaya ke aey logo ! aaj ke din tumharey liye 2 eidein jama ho gaee hain. ( eid aur Juma ( aas-paas ke rehney walon mein se jo shakhs pasand karey Juma ka bhi intizar karey aur agar koi wapas jana chahey (namaz eid ke baad hi ( to wo wapas ja sakta hai, maine usey ijazat de di hai."
"5573","phir main eid ki Namaz mein Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath aaya. unhon-ne bhi Namaz khutbe se pahley padhai phir logon ko khutba diya aur kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumhen apni qurbani ka gosht teen din se zyada khaney ki manaahii ki hai aur Mamar ne Zohri se aur unse abu-Ubaida ne isi tarah bayan kya."
"5574","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qurbani ka gosht teen din tak khaao. Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) Mina se kooch kartey waqt roti Zaitoon ke tel se khaatey, kyonke wo qurbani ke gosht se ( teen din ke baad) parhez kartey they."